        "original_id": "8de4e5fa-8f44-521b-b164-d1425ef94e9a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Bedhead, Hinder, Overseas, Pedro The Lion, Headphones, Centro-matic, South San Gabriel, The New Year\n- People: Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, Cody Hanson, David Bazan, Will Johnson, Bubba Kadane, Matt Kadane\n- Places: Texas, Oklahoma\n- Topics: American indie rock bands, American rock bands\n\nFacts:\n- Bedhead was an American indie rock band based in Texas, and it was active from 1991 to 1998.\n- Hinder is an American rock band from Oklahoma that was formed in 2001 by Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, and Cody Hanson.\n- Overseas is an American indie rock band whose members include David Bazan, Will Johnson, Bubba Kadane, and Matt Kadane.\n- David Bazan was also associated with Pedro The Lion and Headphones.\n- Will Johnson was also associated with Centro-matic and South San Gabriel.\n- Bubba Kadane and Matt Kadane were also associated with Bedhead and The New Year.",
